{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0989"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c083): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c083.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0989"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/olympics","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/sport-games__olympics.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",830],["+","The surest measure of such fame is the vote for Germany's Sportsman of the Year, held by sports journalists since 1947 and organised by the Internationale Sport-Korrespondenz. Nowitzki won it in 2011, a year after Sebastian Vettel. Between 2005 and 2015 one sport provided the male winner more often than any other: athletics, thanks to the discus thrower Robert Harting, who was voted Sportsman of the Year three times in a row from 2012 to 2014. Every other sport in that span – Nordic combined, biathlon, gymnastics, weightlifting, swimming, motorsport, basketball and triathlon – won only once.\n\n"],["=",143],["+","\n| Robert Harting | athletics | Sportsman of the Year 2012–2014 |"]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",790],["+","Der sicherste Gradmesser solcher Berühmtheit ist die Wahl zum deutschen „Sportler des Jahres“, die Sportjournalisten seit 1947 abhalten und die von der Internationalen Sport-Korrespondenz veranstaltet wird. Nowitzki gewann sie 2011, ein Jahr nach Sebastian Vettel. Zwischen 2005 und 2015 stellte eine Sportart den Sieger bei den Männern häufiger als jede andere: die Leichtathletik, dank des Diskuswerfers Robert Harting, der von 2012 bis 2014 dreimal in Folge zum Sportler des Jahres gewählt wurde. Jede andere Sportart in diesem Zeitraum – Nordische Kombination, Biathlon, Turnen, Gewichtheben, Schwimmen, Motorsport, Basketball und Triathlon – gewann nur einmal.\n\n"],["=",131],["+","\n| Robert Harting | Leichtathletik | Sportler des Jahres 2012–2014 |"]]}]},
